import ../../site/games/farm/scene_flags.dl
import ../../site/games/farm/scene_landscape.dl

set world to the initial website farm world
clear world's flags
set landscape to a website Farm landscape for world
set count to the length of landscape's objects
set flags to website Farm flags for world in landscape
require condition ((the length of landscape's objects) = count) reporting "Unplaced flags must not create visible scene objects"
set flag to a new website farm flag
set flag's color to 0
set flag's x to 6
set flag's y to 8
append flag to world's flags
update website Farm flags flags from world dragging ""
set object to the item at 0 in (flags's objects)
require condition (((the length of landscape's objects) = count + 1) and (object's name = "flag-red")) reporting "A placed flag must retain its stable interaction identity"
set cloth to the index of UI scene part named "cloth 0" under 0 in (object's instance's model)
set color to (the item at cloth in (object's instance's materials))'s color
require condition ((color's red = 205) and ((color's green = 99) and (color's blue = 80))) reporting "Flag material must use the authoritative vocabulary palette"
set position to object's instance's root pose's position
set expected to the website Farm scene point at 6 8 in world
require condition ((the length of (position - expected)) < 0.000001) reporting "A flag must sit on its square's actual ground elevation"
ignore (advance website Farm flags flags at 0.25)
set pose to the item at cloth in (object's instance's poses)
require condition ((the absolute value of (pose's rotation's y - (the sine of 6.5) * 0.10)) < 0.000001) reporting "Flag cloth must follow the original wind phase"
set flag's x to 7
replace item at index 0 in world's flags with flag
update website Farm flags flags from world dragging "flag-red"
require condition ((the length of (object's instance's root pose's position - position)) < 0.000001) reporting "A world refresh must preserve an actively dragged flag's position"
update website Farm flags flags from world dragging ""
set expected to the website Farm scene point at 7 8 in world
require condition ((the length of (object's instance's root pose's position - expected)) < 0.000001) reporting "A completed flag move must use the updated world square"
clear world's flags
update website Farm flags flags from world dragging ""
require condition ((the length of landscape's objects) = count) reporting "Removing a flag left an owned scene object behind"
close website Farm flags flags
close website Farm landscape landscape
free website farm world world
print line "Farm flags use the shared text palette, retain drag positions, animate cloth and release removed objects."
